  "Applications", "ExampleSection",ExpressionUUID->
   "d88cfd98-a4cb-495b-82fc-47cbc65ad5c1"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSection",
 CellID->872514143,ExpressionUUID->"d9630cfa-c19f-4a4a-9b19-c920115d4f5f"],

Cell["\<\
In the representation theory of the symmetric group Sn, the irreducible \
representations are indexed by partitions of n, and the irrep labelled by the \
conjugate partition is the tensor product of the original irrep with the sign \
representation. The two irreps share the same dimension; verify on the \
partitions of 7:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->812660169,ExpressionUUID->"cd038e5f-56d2-4b02-a461-826e9e61cbde"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"IntegerPartitions", "[", "7", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"TableauDimension", "[", "#1", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TableauDimension", "[", 
      RowBox[{"TransposePartition", "[", "#1", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}]}], 
  " ", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->318047898,ExpressionUUID->"1ca1aca4-77cd-4336-b8a7-db91b63f8458"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->229919155,ExpressionUUID->"3a7c0f92-cea6-408d-8962-8d68c650a9be"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "\t", "ExampleDelimiter",ExpressionUUID->
   "cb4e336e-aa1c-4b4b-b5b9-c622524736d4"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter",
 CellID->621618535,ExpressionUUID->"dace8a93-134f-4419-8970-0c135f99ae59"],

Cell["\<\
The Young symmetrizer for a tableau symmetrizes rows of the original \
partition and antisymmetrizes columns. The column structure is exactly the \
conjugate partition; here is the row shape and its transpose for {3, 1}:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->400699173,ExpressionUUID->"9cebfd1b-1389-4ca9-a63e-a7c7ced1e18d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TransposePartition", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->275895987,ExpressionUUID->"8ed508d9-124a-4789-bb5a-2994353dee8a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->457926433,ExpressionUUID->"795deacf-3cc2-4347-a0d5-361c073068c5"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "\t", "ExampleDelimiter",ExpressionUUID->
   "bbe6b4ee-1a09-427e-9121-45e06cb9b9ad"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter",
 CellID->130273570,ExpressionUUID->"ba5f70ba-abb0-4562-bb3e-032c351355b8"],

Cell["\<\
Pair every partition of 6 with its conjugate. Self-conjugate partitions \
appear paired with themselves; non-self-conjugate ones in dual pairs:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->67834248,ExpressionUUID->"ef169da7-12af-4bfd-8fba-43271e937826"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"#1", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TransposePartition", "[", "#1", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "&"}], 
   " ", ")"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
  RowBox[{"IntegerPartitions", "[", "6", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->829035141,ExpressionUUID->"ff4cefeb-8661-4adb-b2c8-50938aa9229f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "6", "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], 
      "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"5", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2", ",", "2"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"5", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", "6", "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->150654265,ExpressionUUID->"8e126ce3-21ef-4e69-a328-9c4ab789a728"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

